{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_town009_kanban_01",
      "hash": "fb2eb207c83c71be",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這裡是紅蓮鎮\\n紅蓮即是熱情如火的鮮紅之色"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_town009_kanban_02",
      "hash": "fb2eb107c83c700b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這裡是紅蓮研究所\\n寶可夢研究設施"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_town009_kanban_03",
      "hash": "fb2eb007c83c6e58",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "紅蓮島寶可夢道館\\n館主夏伯\\r\\n熱血猜謎大叔"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_town009_door_01",
      "hash": "7c8fc01f8569409f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "門上面用很小的字\\n寫著些什麼……！\\c\\n「問題！\\n　這間道館的鑰匙在哪裡呢？\\c\\n　提示！在一棟被青草纏繞著的\\n　建築物某處……？」"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_town009_youngf_01_01",
      "hash": "a8d70bfaf363b6cd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "聽說紅蓮道館的夏伯是個怪人，\\n他在研究所成立以前\\r\\n就住在這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_town009_oldm_01_01",
      "hash": "8b31d9faa53907bb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "為了研究，科學家們似乎\\n偶爾會出入寶可夢屋。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_town009_poke_01",
      "hash": "e5ebf5a8a6bca1dc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "鴨嘴火獸「鴨嘴～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_town009_poke_02",
      "hash": "e5ebf8a8a6bca6f5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "海星星「咻嚕～"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_masaki_01_p01_field_t009",
      "hash": "25ecb5b7db5663cc",
